title: Cloudflare D1 Global
agents: cloudflare
catalog: cloud/cloudflare
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the overall Cloudflare D1 usage for the account.
 It reports total database count, total storage, daily rows read/written
 against included free-tier thresholds (Free: 10 DBs, 5GB storage, 5M reads/day, 100K writes/day).
 Paid plans are usage-based and free-tier monitoring can be disabled in the ruleset.

discovery:
 One service is created per Cloudflare account.
